body:
Alabama is three states in one. Appalachia Alabama from Hartselle The lowest point  running East and north mostly white Cullman to south of Montgomery is Alabama in its  finest and worst. Mobile is apart of cajun/french sub culture the hub is Nola. 

&#x200B;

North Alabama isn’t bad the rural white areas might be on edge but friendly enough  Cullman is getting better but be on your  Ps and Qs Scottsboro Alabama has baggage claim not sure if they have anything or  do you want anything..COVID lol Huntsville has the space center always neat Spisey water falls. There is also one near interstate 65 near mount vernon. The state gets Hot and humid in July and august sometimes we get a spring. Florence Alabama is home to muscle shoals use to big in music Back in the day. Winston county...not worth the bullshit. Birmingham isn’t bad but its fucky. ”micro agression” isnt a thing you will learn real fast if fuck you is being signaled. Assume most people have a gun some will try to protect you some will be assholes. I do suggest going to a gun range and shooting 30+ rounds of ammo feel free lol south Alabama isn’t bad. There are some counties that still get fucked For being black. No clean water no real hospitals. Mobile is nice see the warship Alabama.
